<title>SWEDEN: Volvo Construction bids for Champion Road.</title>
<headline>Volvo Construction bids for Champion Road.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The construction unit of Sweden's AB Volvo on Thursday announced a 950 million crown takeover bid for Canadian road building equipment company Champion Road Machinery Ltd.</p>
<p>Volvo Construction Equipment Corp said it was offering CA$15 a share amounting to a total of CA$173 million.</p>
